"""
The texts my five criteria are run against, kept in one place so the run is
reproducible. `scenarios.py` reads from here.

    HUMAN_TEXTS   10 pieces supplied by me as human-written. Used for criterion 1
                  (at most 1 of 10 labeled AI) and criterion 5 (the human side
                  of the score gap). Pasted exactly as supplied, typos and all.
    AI_TEXTS      5 pieces generated by Claude on 2026-11-15, in an ordinary
                  explanatory style. Used for criterion 5 (the AI side) and as
                  the "clearly AI" input for criterion 3.

Every text has to be 45 to 300 words, or /submit refuses it with a 400 before
it is ever scored. `python eval_texts.py` checks that and prints the counts.
"""

